From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Radensky <fradensky@nvidia.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:54:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] platform/mellanox: nvsw-host-nvl6: Add support for N6164_LD

N6164_LD (SKU HI196) is an NVL6 switch built on the same VMOD0023
management board and the same host CPLD as N6100_LD. It differs from
N6100_LD by the absence of the cable cartridge EEPROMs and of the leakage
sensors, both of which are handled by the user space, so the system
shares the N6100_LD configuration and only needs its own DMI match.

Signed-off-by: Felix Radensky <fradensky@nvidia.com>
---
 drivers/platform/mellanox/nvsw-host-nvl6.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/platform/mellanox/nvsw-host-nvl6.c b/drivers/platform/mellanox/nvsw-host-nvl6.c
index dec6383..cde3782 100644
--- a/drivers/platform/mellanox/nvsw-host-nvl6.c
+++ b/drivers/platform/mellanox/nvsw-host-nvl6.c
@@ -663,6 +663,13 @@ static const struct dmi_system_id nvsw_host_dmi_table[] __initconst = {
 			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_PRODUCT_SKU, "HI180"),
 		},
 	},
+	{
+		.callback = nvsw_host_dmi_nvl6_switch_matched,
+		.matches = {
+			DMI_MATCH(DMI_BOARD_NAME, "VMOD0023"),
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_PRODUCT_SKU, "HI196"),
+		},
+	},
 	{ }
 };
 
